@format 1
@id media-loading.in-edit
@title In Edit
@section Media loading
@area In Edit
@entry edit-items-add
@summary Show the Edit-specific persistent-plan initialization that runs after new media entries have been added to the program Files docket.
@related media-loading.common.docket-insertion
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag edit

@alias edit = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab

[edit-items-add] Newly loaded Edit entries announced <input>
~ This starts with newly loaded Edit entries announced.
[Technical explanation]
= PListItemsAdd synchronously delivers all newly added docket entries after insertion.
> edit-items-result

[edit-items-result] Carried Edit plan available <decision>
~ The program checks carried Edit plan available.
[Technical explanation]
- PEditItemsHandle returns while plan loading is active or when no carried persistent Edit plan exists @ edit.PEditItemsHandle(...)
? "Carried plan applies" > edit-items-save
? "No carried plan" > edit-items-nochange

[edit-items-save] Save carried Edit plan for each new entry <process>
~ This step handles save carried Edit plan for each new entry.
[Technical explanation]
- For every newly loaded entry, read any source-specific Edit plan, resolve it against the carried plan, and save the resolved result @ edit.PEditItemsHandle(...)
> edit-items-saved

[edit-items-nochange] Loaded entries need no Edit initialization <output>
~ This path ends with loaded entries need no Edit initialization.
[Technical explanation]
= PListItemsAdd causes no Edit plan write when no carried plan applies.

[edit-items-saved] Loaded Edit entries initialized <output>
~ This path ends with loaded Edit entries initialized.
[Technical explanation]
= Carried Edit state has been resolved and saved for every newly loaded media entry.
